<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="cs">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Rozvaha</title>
<style>
    /* mPDF kvirky: single class names, žádné nested selectory, padding v <td> ne v <div> */
    body { font-family: montserrat, dejavusans, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; color: #15131D; }
    .header-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 4mm; }
    .header-table td { vertical-align: top; }
    .header-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; }
    .header-scope { font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 1mm; }
    .header-meta { font-size: 8pt; color: #555; margin-top: 0.5mm; }
    .entity-info { text-align: right; font-size: 9pt; }
    .section-title {
        font-size: 10pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 4mm;
        margin-bottom: 1mm;
        padding: 1mm 0;
        border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #999;
    }
    table.statement { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    table.statement thead th {
        font-size: 7pt;
        font-weight: normal;
        color: #555;
        text-align: right;
        padding: 1mm 1.5mm;
        border-bottom: 0.3pt solid #ccc;
        vertical-align: bottom;
    }
    table.statement thead th.thl { text-align: left; }
    table.statement tbody td {
        padding: 0.8mm 1.5mm;
        font-size: 8pt;
        border-bottom: 0.2pt solid #eee;
        vertical-align: top;
    }
    table.statement tbody tr.row-strong td {
        font-weight: bold;
        border-bottom: 0.3pt solid #ccc;
    }
    .num { text-align: right; }
    .col-code { width: 18mm; }
    .col-num { width: 24mm; }
    .checks-title { font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 4mm; margin-bottom: 1mm; }
    .check-line { font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0.5mm; }
    .check-ok { color: #166534; }
    .check-fail { color: #b91c1c; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% set scope_label = scope == 'full'
    ? 'v plném rozsahu'
    : (scope == 'small' ? 've zkráceném rozsahu (malá účetní jednotka)' : 've zkráceném rozsahu (mikro účetní jednotka)') %}

<table class="header-table">
    <tr>
        <td style="width:55%;">
            <div class="header-title">ROZVAHA</div>
            <div class="header-scope">{{ scope_label }}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">k rozvahovému dni {{ as_of|cz_date }} (v celých tisících Kč)</div>
            <div class="header-meta">Fiskální rok {{ period.fiscal_year }}{% if prev_period %}, minulé období: fiskální rok {{ prev_period.fiscal_year }}{% endif %}</div>
            <div class="header-meta">Okamžik sestavení: {{ entity.prepared_at }} · verze výkazu: {{ version_code }}</div>
            {% if dimension is defined and dimension and dimension.label %}<div class="header-scope"><strong>Dimenze: {{ dimension.label }}</strong> (jen řádky s touto hodnotou, rozpad poměrem)</div>{% endif %}
            {% include '_accrual_spread_note.twig' %}
        </td>
        <td style="width:45%;" class="entity-info">
            <strong>{{ entity.name }}</strong><br>
            IČO: {{ entity.ico }}<br>
            {{ entity.address }}
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="section-title">AKTIVA</div>
<table class="statement">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="thl col-code">Označení</th>
            <th class="thl">Položka</th>
            <th class="col-num">Brutto</th>
            <th class="col-num">Korekce</th>
            <th class="col-num">Netto</th>
            <th class="col-num">Minulé obd.</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for row in assets %}
            <tr class="{{ row.row_type != 'detail' ? 'row-strong' : '' }}">
                <td>{{ row.display_code }}</td>
                <td style="padding-left: {{ 1.5 + row.level * 4 }}mm;">{{ row.label }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.gross|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.correction|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.net|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.prev_net|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>

<div class="section-title">PASIVA</div>
<table class="statement">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th class="thl col-code">Označení</th>
            <th class="thl">Položka</th>
            <th class="col-num">Běžné obd.</th>
            <th class="col-num">Minulé obd.</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for row in liabilities %}
            <tr class="{{ row.row_type != 'detail' ? 'row-strong' : '' }}">
                <td>{{ row.display_code }}</td>
                <td style="padding-left: {{ 1.5 + row.level * 4 }}mm;">{{ row.label }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.amount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
                <td class="num">{{ row.prev_amount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>

<div class="checks-title">Kontrola</div>
<div class="check-line {{ checks.balanced ? 'check-ok' : 'check-fail' }}">
    {{ checks.balanced ? '✓' : '✗' }} AKTIVA netto {{ checks.assets_net|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} = PASIVA {{ checks.liabilities_total|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }}
</div>
<div class="check-line">
    Hodnoty jsou v celých tisících Kč, zaokrouhleny po řádcích (§4 odst. 3 vyhl. č. 500/2002 Sb.);
    součtové řádky se počítají z hodnot v Kč — proti součtu zaokrouhlených položek může vzniknout rozdíl ±1 tis. Kč.
</div>

</body>
</html>
